  "_source": "Dashboard rows derive from builder-server CollectionCuration (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/decentraland/builder-server/master/src/Curation/CollectionCuration/CollectionCuration.types.ts: id, collection_id, assignee, status pending|approved|rejected, created_at, updated_at) + patchCurationSchema { status, assignee } (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/decentraland/builder-server/master/src/Curation/Curation.types.ts), with the dashboard display state derived as the builder frontend's getCollectionCurationState (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/decentraland/builder/master/src/modules/curations/collectionCuration). The committee rows mirror app/fixtures/builder-curation.json. NEW: CurationComment models the curator's approve/reject reasoning, which the real builder posts to the collection's forum topic as a ForumNewPost { raw, topic_id } (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/decentraland/builder-server/master/src/Forum/Forum.types.ts). The live catalyst /v1/collections/{id}/items/{item}/status PATCH + the forum post are bearer/committee gated and 404 via public nginx, so the decide+comment commit is SIMULATED; the request body mirrors patchCurationSchema { status } and ForumNewPost { raw, topic_id }.",
